Wrong Turn 2: Dead End is a horror, thriller film directed by Joe Lynch.

3
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:39,000
Retired military commander Colonel Dale Murphy hosts the simulated post-apocalyptic reality show
where participants are challenged to survive a remote West Virginia wasteland.

4
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:30,000
But the show turns into a nightmarish showdown when each realizes they are being hunted
by an inbred family of cannibals determined to make them all dinner!

